    "text": "By Jenna Guzman ,\n4 hours ago MYRTLE BEACH, SC (WMBF) - Community is speaking out after they say thieves stole their mail in their Myrtle Beach neighborhoods. People in the Castillo del Mar neighborhood of the Grand Dunes said thieves have come by their homes in the early morning hours between 2 and 4 a.m. to steal from their mailboxes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
